WEBVTT

00:09:25.409 --> 00:09:34.038
(Smijeh)

00:09:34.038 --> 00:09:42.822
(Pljesak)

00:09:42.822 --> 00:09:45.427
Dok klinci stvaraju ovakve projekte,

00:09:45.427 --> 00:09:47.692
uče programirati,

00:09:47.692 --> 00:09:51.626
no još važnije, 
programiraju kako bi učili.

00:09:51.626 --> 00:09:53.915
Jer dok uče programirati,

00:09:53.915 --> 00:09:57.235
to im dopušta da nauče 
mnogo drugih stvari,

00:09:57.235 --> 00:10:00.107
otvara mnoge druge prilike za učenje.